      "writtenOn": "2025-10-13T14:00:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The change in review uses parent number only if it exists. To me it seems that the change https://gerrit-review.git.corp.google.com/c/gerrit/+/318241 introduced a bug. When we look into PatchListKey.java, javadoc there says that we should use parentNum if available when oldId is null. This is what this change under review does. Did I misunderstand something?",
