      "writtenOn": "2025-10-13T14:08:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe there is a bug in the code (sorry I didn\u0027t have time to inspect the code), but the current behaviour of the file operator seems to be WAI, i.e. a change only matches if the file has been changed when the comparison is done against the default base (which is the auto-merge). Did I get this wrong?\n\nIt would be unexpected if the behaviour is matching against a non-default base (first parent). This would be inconsistent as everywhere else we use the auto-merge as the default base for merge commits.",
      "parentUuid": "0cd22110_8024c6f0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 57,
        "endLine": 10,
